  "label": "Adolf Hitler glorified as a hero",
  "description": "The meme uses the term 'hero' in reference to Adolf Hitler, a figure universally condemned for orchestrating the Holocaust and genocide of millions, particularly Jews, during World War II. This is a direct and hateful inversion of historical reality, using irony to mock the idea of glorifying a mass murderer. The background knowledge required is the global historical consensus that Hitler is one of history's most evil figures, and that any attempt to label him a 'hero' is a profound distortion of truth and a dangerous trivialization of genocide.",
